  "problem": "Consider the matrix\n    $D=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].$\nWhat are the dimensions of ${D}^{T}?$",
